WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:43:19.888 --> 00:43:23.648
Humanity is facing
a multitude of existential threats,

00:43:23.696 --> 00:43:27.648
from climate change to malnutrition
to the rising cost of living.

00:43:27.696 --> 00:43:29.808
It feels like we need a hero.

00:43:29.856 --> 00:43:32.048
But not all heroes wear capes.

00:43:32.096 --> 00:43:35.808
Sometimes they can be found
in the unlikeliest of places,

00:43:35.856 --> 00:43:38.560
like on your toast in the morning.

00:43:38.608 --> 00:43:42.688
Could the answer to the world's
problems be the humble bean?

00:43:42.736 --> 00:43:46.528
Beans are a dietary staple of nearly
every culture across the globe,

00:43:46.576 --> 00:43:48.336
and for good reason.

00:43:48.368 --> 00:43:50.208
Not to toot their own horn,

00:43:50.256 --> 00:43:52.976
but boasting
around 40,000 different varieties,

00:43:53.024 --> 00:43:55.648
beans are highly versatile,
nutritious, cheap

00:43:55.696 --> 00:43:57.648
and great for the environment.

00:43:57.696 --> 00:44:01.168
Part of the legume family,
botanically, beans are a vegetable

00:44:01.216 --> 00:44:03.808
and come in many different
shapes and sizes -

00:44:03.856 --> 00:44:08.336
from fresh beans and peas to dried
seeds like lentils and chickpeas.

00:44:08.384 --> 00:44:10.560
If you're confused
whether you should treat them

00:44:10.608 --> 00:44:13.008
as a veg or a protein
on your plate,

00:44:13.056 --> 00:44:16.016
the answer is they can be
either or both.

00:44:16.064 --> 00:44:18.528
For example,
fresh peas and green beans

00:44:18.576 --> 00:44:20.416
are considered starchy vegetables,

00:44:20.448 --> 00:44:22.368
while the high protein content

00:44:22.416 --> 00:44:24.816
of kidney beans, black beans
and chickpeas

00:44:24.848 --> 00:44:27.408
means they tick the boxes
of both food groups.

00:44:27.456 --> 00:44:30.768
In a world where
two and a half billion people

00:44:30.816 --> 00:44:33.808
are either overweight,
obese or malnourished,

00:44:33.856 --> 00:44:36.144
beans are a nutritional all-rounder.

00:44:36.160 --> 00:44:40.096
Not only are they an inexpensive
substitute for animal products,

00:44:40.128 --> 00:44:43.456
but they're both low-fat
and nutrient-rich,

00:44:43.488 --> 00:44:46.336
high in protein, iron,
zinc and fibre.

00:44:46.384 --> 00:44:48.896
They contain
indigestible carbohydrates

00:44:48.944 --> 00:44:51.088
that feed the bacteria
in the large bowel,

00:44:51.136 --> 00:44:53.376
making them great for our guts.

00:44:53.408 --> 00:44:57.024
While all beans contain
a mix of essential amino acids,

00:44:57.040 --> 00:44:59.936
soybeans have the best ratios
for our health.

00:44:59.968 --> 00:45:02.656
Other beans don't have that balance,
but around the world,

00:45:02.688 --> 00:45:04.768
people have traditionally
paired them

00:45:04.816 --> 00:45:07.488
with foods that make the meal
nutritionally complete.

00:45:07.536 --> 00:45:12.176
Think beans on toast, bean burritos,
rice and peas, dhal and chapatis.

00:45:12.208 --> 00:45:14.496
Everything is better with beans.

00:45:14.544 --> 00:45:16.048
While beans are well known

00:45:16.096 --> 00:45:19.856
for their role in - to put it
delicately - releasing gases,

00:45:19.888 --> 00:45:22.128
they can also do the opposite.

00:45:22.176 --> 00:45:25.728
Beans play a unique and important
role in crucial ecosystems

00:45:25.776 --> 00:45:28.688
like forests, grasslands
and wetlands.

00:45:28.736 --> 00:45:30.256
The bacteria in their roots

00:45:30.304 --> 00:45:33.856
take in nitrogen from the atmosphere
and store it in the soil.

00:45:33.888 --> 00:45:36.816
This process,
known as nitrogen fixing,

00:45:36.848 --> 00:45:39.888
not only provides nutrients
for trees and other plants

00:45:39.936 --> 00:45:42.976
but acts as a natural fertiliser
in agriculture,

00:45:43.008 --> 00:45:45.568
greatly reducing the need
for synthetic ones

00:45:45.616 --> 00:45:47.888
and lowering chemical pollution.

00:45:47.936 --> 00:45:51.808
In a world of ever increasing
temperatures, beans are survivors,

00:45:51.856 --> 00:45:54.096
able to grow in a wide range
of climates,

00:45:54.128 --> 00:45:57.728
from the broad beans of the UK
to the adzuki of the Himalayas.

00:45:57.776 --> 00:46:01.376
They're hardy, on average requiring
less water in their production

00:46:01.408 --> 00:46:03.776
than rice, wheat or animal products.

00:46:03.808 --> 00:46:05.744
And given that global water demand

00:46:05.760 --> 00:46:09.248
is likely to increase
by more than 40% by 2030,

00:46:09.296 --> 00:46:12.048
this is quite a superpower.

00:46:12.096 --> 00:46:14.768
Beans have sometimes
been misunderstood.

00:46:14.816 --> 00:46:18.288
Researchers once worried
that the isoflavones found in soy

00:46:18.336 --> 00:46:21.888
could cause health issues
by mimicking the hormone oestrogen.

00:46:21.936 --> 00:46:26.048
But, thankfully, more recent studies
have found no evidence of this.

00:46:26.096 --> 00:46:29.056
In fact, modern research suggests
that soy could even

00:46:29.088 --> 00:46:32.768
lower cancer risk
and help maintain healthy hearts.

00:46:32.816 --> 00:46:37.168
Another concern is that growing
soya beans leads to deforestation

00:46:37.216 --> 00:46:38.928
in places like the Amazon.

00:46:38.976 --> 00:46:42.848
But in fact, nearly 80% of soy
produced in the region

00:46:42.880 --> 00:46:45.536
is used to feed
the animals that feed us.

00:46:45.568 --> 00:46:48.384
If we ate less meat and more soy,

00:46:48.400 --> 00:46:50.816
we would need to use
a lot less land,

00:46:50.848 --> 00:46:52.608
which would mean less pressure

00:46:52.656 --> 00:46:56.368
to convert forests and
natural habitats for growing food.

00:46:56.416 --> 00:46:59.216
Like everything in life,
beans aren't perfect.

00:47:00.208 --> 00:47:03.056
For those who haven't had beans
consistently in their diet,

00:47:03.088 --> 00:47:05.040
they may need to
introduce them slowly

00:47:05.088 --> 00:47:07.696
to get used to their bulk
and high fibre content.

00:47:07.728 --> 00:47:10.768
Some people find that conditions
like irritable bowel syndrome

00:47:10.816 --> 00:47:12.816
can be exacerbated by some beans,

00:47:12.848 --> 00:47:15.936
though soaking and cooking
the beans thoroughly may help.

00:47:15.968 --> 00:47:19.808
Kidney and cannellini beans
contain high levels of lectin,

00:47:19.856 --> 00:47:21.936
a protein that makes them toxic,

00:47:21.968 --> 00:47:25.616
so they definitely need to be cooked
properly to avoid food poisoning

00:47:25.648 --> 00:47:28.016
if bought dried or raw.

00:47:28.064 --> 00:47:31.136
On balance, though,
whilst beans can't be expected

00:47:31.168 --> 00:47:33.088
to fix all the ills of the world,

00:47:33.136 --> 00:47:34.928
given their incredible abundance,

00:47:34.976 --> 00:47:37.248
nutritional value,
environmental benefits

00:47:37.296 --> 00:47:39.808
and the myriad delicious ways
they can be eaten,

00:47:39.856 --> 00:47:42.368
the future looks decidedly beany.

